### CareerLeap API — manual tests
### Install the VS Code extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client),
### then click "Send Request" above each block. Cookies are kept between requests,
### so after Register/Login the protected /dashboard calls work.

@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Register (sets the login cookie)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@career-leap.academy",
  "password": "secret123",
  "track": "data"
}

### 3. Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@career-leap.academy",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### 4. Who am I? (needs login)
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### 5. Dashboard data (needs login) — copy a task "_id" from the response for step 6
GET {{base}}/dashboard

### 6. Toggle a task (replace TASK_ID)
PATCH {{base}}/dashboard/tasks/TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "done": true }

### 7. Log hours
POST {{base}}/dashboard/hours
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hours": 3 }

### 8. Forgot password — in dev the response includes "devResetUrl"; copy the token from it
POST {{base}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@career-leap.academy" }

### 9. Reset password (replace TOKEN)
POST {{base}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "TOKEN",
  "password": "newpass456"
}

### 10. Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
